P('6.1.1-03','State what A counts.','Protons plus neutrons.',1,'One mark for total nucleons.')
P('6.1.2-01','Explain why carbon-12 and carbon-14 are isotopes.','They share six protons and therefore element identity. Their nucleon and neutron numbers differ.',2,'One mark for equal proton number; one for different neutron/nucleon number.')
